              "\\int\\dfrac{dx}{\\cos^2 x}=\\tan x+C",
              "\\int\\dfrac{dx}{\\sin^2 x}=-\\cot x+C",
              "\\int\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}=\\arcsin x+C",
